 "description": "Number of deck boards for a rectangular deck, accounting for board width and gap. Formula: Rows = \u2308width(in) \u00f7 (board width + gap)\u2309; boards = rows \u00d7 \u2308deck length \u00f7 board length\u2309 \u00d7 (1 + waste%).",
